{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The DNA Fighting Universe has arrived!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DNAVERSUS launches in 2027 worldwide and is the new Free to Play anime Platform Fighter from the DNA Franchise by solo indie dev studio Inoa Games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/0eb7e1f37164d544868c0103271ef9b2.poster.avif?t=1774032922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/0eb7e1f37164d544868c0103271ef9b2.webm?t=1774032922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/0eb7e1f37164d544868c0103271ef9b2.mp4?t=1774032922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by the creators of the DNA Franchise Inoa Games. DNAVERSUS introduces its new Platform 2d Fighting game in the DNA Story Universe as you are able fight in the epic battles as all the DNA Characters in the DNA Franchise and fight amongst each other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive DNA Character Selection in DNAVERSUS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will become the most powerful DNA fighter in the Cosmos!? DNAVERUS will start off with 8 Playable Characters and over 85+ DLC Character from the DNA 1 Game series and Upcoming DNA Game titles that you can master in an epic story mode, local vs mode, casual online or competitive online ranked play to test your might and become a legend in the DNA Universe!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/620478c7be20102cb6790e483d290e41.poster.avif?t=1774032922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/620478c7be20102cb6790e483d290e41.webm?t=1774032922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/620478c7be20102cb6790e483d290e41.mp4?t=1774032922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action packed Fighting Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DNAVERSUS introduces a new platform fighting anime style combat system with combo moves, counter attacks, throw abilities and absolutely insane anime style special power up attacks that will leave you in awe when the DNA Power Gauge is filled up to max.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/80ee946db0e8e8140cae693c5131a0df.poster.avif?t=1774032922\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/80ee946db0e8e8140cae693c5131a0df.webm?t=1774032922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/extras/80ee946db0e8e8140cae693c5131a0df.mp4?t=1774032922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847350?t=1774032922","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/b0aff79b7630aacbb0668312a7519af938113c81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774032922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847350/95307d13aae35ad303dbc8d4eed91040314fbd49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774032922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847